One pass on a 3 × 3 patch with w = 0.7 (the default is 0.97; a smaller w is drawn so the moves show). The bottom and sides are frozen, the two middle top vertices are on the arc (red). The result is identical to `laplace(passes=1, w=0.7)`. The followed vertex moves 0.15 of an edge in (b); the snap moves are smaller, 0.029 and 0.024 of an edge in the insets.
